(299,'CMD-20260408202601-98b9fc','commend',45,18,3,5,'Driven by Purpose and Shows consideration for oneself and others:\r\nAte Grace carries out her role with strong commitment and has proven to be an effective co-captain, especially since Nicko isn’t around. She makes sure the team stays goal-driven and excited to work together. Beyond being my teammate in Team Earthquake, she’s also been very open and welcoming, making me feel comfortable both professionally and personally.',NULL,'approved',4,'2026-07-14 09:40:49','Small, consistent acts like this are what Genuinely Caring looks like day to day. Thank you for taking the time to notice and name it - it reinforces the kind of colleague we want more of.','2026-07-15 06:20:03','2026-04-08 12:26:01','internal',NULL,NULL),
(300,'CMD-20260408203400-500286','commend',45,30,4,3,'Nicko has always been the room’s energy and the life of the party. He has a way of making everyone feel good whenever he’s around, keeping the work environment light and stress-free. He also takes the initiative when it comes to activities, whether they’re work-related or just for fun.',NULL,'approved',4,'2026-07-14 09:40:49','This captures Fun and Focused well - keeping spirits high without losing sight of the work. Moments like this are a big part of why people enjoy being part of the team.','2026-07-15 05:59:05','2026-04-08 12:34:00','internal',NULL,NULL),
(301,'CMD-20260408203847-0e9a02','commend',45,8,1,5,'Aljay has always been very accommodating and helpful whenever I have tech issues with my computer or the system. He’s always willing to help out anytime.',NULL,'approved',4,'2026-07-14 09:40:49','This is a great example of Exceeding Expectations - going beyond the ask instead of settling for the minimum. Recognizing this kind of initiative encourages the whole team to keep raising the bar.','2026-07-15 06:00:18','2026-04-08 12:38:47','internal',NULL,NULL),
(302,'CMD-20260408205014-e7d752','commend',45,46,1,5,'Josh has always been the team’s initiator, motivator, and problem solver. His wit and humor keep everyone confident and excited at work, and he makes sure no one feels left out. No doubt, he’s a natural leader and a great friend to everyone. \r\nHe maintains a good balance between professionalism and personal connection with each team member.',NULL,'approved',4,'2026-07-14 09:40:49','This is a great example of Exceeding Expectations - going beyond the ask instead of settling for the minimum. Recognizing this kind of initiative encourages the whole team to keep raising the bar.','2026-07-15 06:56:07','2026-04-08 12:50:14','internal',NULL,NULL),
(303,'CMD-20260408205746-fd6b01','commend',45,47,2,5,'Cy has shown professionalism, dedication to her work, and genuine care for the company. She might seem quiet at times, but she’s focused, knows her responsibilities, and understands the value of going the extra mile. She’s also open to healthy discussions, whether it’s about work matters or sharing personal beliefs. She’s always been accommodating, willing to help, and eager to learn.',NULL,'approved',4,'2026-07-14 09:40:49','This shows real Remarkably Flexible - staying open to change and bouncing back without losing momentum. Calling it out reinforces that adaptability is valued here, not just tolerated.','2026-07-15 05:55:05','2026-04-08 12:57:46','internal',NULL,NULL),
(304,'CMD-20260409022522-a973c5','commend',22,18,1,4,'Goes beyond engagement.\r\n\r\nAte Apple, the team leader of the Team Earthquake really motivates people. Recently, she invited me to join a team meeting even though I work on a different schedule, and that made me feel included and encouraged.',NULL,'approved',4,'2026-07-14 09:40:49','This is a great example of Exceeding Expectations - going beyond the ask instead of settling for the minimum. Recognizing this kind of initiative encourages the whole team to keep raising the bar.','2026-07-15 06:20:16','2026-04-08 18:25:22','internal',NULL,NULL),
