(327,'CMD-20260414230519-c00e75','commend',30,37,1,5,'- Goes beyond engagement	\r\n\r\nI would like to formally request a commendation for Team Earthquake (10 members only) following our first official Epicenter Assembly. The event was a resounding success, marked by an incredible level of energy and a shared commitment to our upcoming goals.\r\n\r\nThe team demonstrated exceptional volunteerism and teamwork throughout the session. Beyond just attending, everyone was highly enthusiastic and eager to participate in the Star Commendation Challenge, which has already sparked a positive competitive spirit within the group. We utilized the assembly to successfully map out our strategic goals and establish a clear timeline for our upcoming activities.\r\n\r\nThe momentum generated from this assembly is a testament to the team’s dedication - evidenced by the off-duty members who voluntarily joined the conference call to contribute to our strategy.\r\n\r\nI believe acknowledging their hard work and \"all-in\" and \"can-do\" attitude at this stage will further solidify the strong foundation we’ve built. #SeismicForce #UnstoppableCourse','1776179119_Team_Earthquake_Meeting_2__1_.png','approved',4,'2026-07-14 09:40:49','This is a great example of Exceeding Expectations - going beyond the ask instead of settling for the minimum. Recognizing this kind of initiative encourages the whole team to keep raising the bar.','2026-07-15 06:23:08','2026-04-14 15:05:19','internal',NULL,NULL),
