(430,'CMD-20260430155901-2bc18f','commend',54,54,1,5,'I commend myself for the reason that I\'m able to witness my improvement in every task that I do since the day I arrived here in Resono. My task for my first month here is issuing vouchers and I\'m proud to say that I achieved multiple no errors in the files that I worked with. Meanwhile, the errors that I\'m making in seatrem decreases every week. That just shows how dedicated I am for the tasks that were given to me. I\'m really grateful for everyone who helped me to grow professionally here in Resono, but above all, I credit myself for the perseverance and eagerness to learn and improve every single day. I have a long way to go, and I\'ll keep on trusting the process.',NULL,'approved',4,'2026-07-14 09:40:49','This is a great example of Exceeding Expectations - going beyond the ask instead of settling for the minimum. Recognizing this kind of initiative encourages the whole team to keep raising the bar. (Self-commendation - consistent with other self-commendations you\'ve approved this quarter, e.g. rows on UATP and RDOT completion.)','2026-07-14 17:56:22','2026-04-30 07:59:01','internal',NULL,NULL),
(431,'CMD-20260430235938-141e40','commend',30,2,4,3,'Promotes a fun working environment\r\n\r\nI would like to formally commend Team Earthquake for their exceptional execution of the Alab ng Sipag Labor Day event. The team successfully transformed the production floor into a dynamic space that perfectly balanced high-energy engagement with meaningful employee recognition.\r\n\r\nBy launching creative initiatives like the Tatak Sipag, Tatak Pinoy photo exhibit and the interactive #LaborWin Wall, Team Earthquake fostered a unique environment where employees felt both seen and celebrated. Every Quake Maker was there from start to finish (even the silent and the least expected ones participated)\r\n\r\nThis event didn\'t just celebrate Labor Day; it strengthened our office culture, elevated team spirit, and showcased the true \"Alab ng Sipag\" of our workforce.','1777564778_img_0608.jpg','approved',4,'2026-07-14 09:40:49','This captures Fun and Focused well - keeping spirits high without losing sight of the work. Moments like this are a big part of why people enjoy being part of the team.','2026-07-14 17:29:03','2026-04-30 15:59:38','internal',NULL,NULL),
