(444,'CMD-20260430235938-141e40','commend',30,50,4,3,'Promotes a fun working environment\r\n\r\nI would like to formally commend Team Earthquake for their exceptional execution of the Alab ng Sipag Labor Day event. The team successfully transformed the production floor into a dynamic space that perfectly balanced high-energy engagement with meaningful employee recognition.\r\n\r\nBy launching creative initiatives like the Tatak Sipag, Tatak Pinoy photo exhibit and the interactive #LaborWin Wall, Team Earthquake fostered a unique environment where employees felt both seen and celebrated. Every Quake Maker was there from start to finish (even the silent and the least expected ones participated)\r\n\r\nThis event didn\'t just celebrate Labor Day; it strengthened our office culture, elevated team spirit, and showcased the true \"Alab ng Sipag\" of our workforce.','1777564778_img_0608.jpg','approved',4,'2026-07-14 09:40:49','This captures Fun and Focused well - keeping spirits high without losing sight of the work. Moments like this are a big part of why people enjoy being part of the team.','2026-07-15 07:09:22','2026-04-30 15:59:38','internal',NULL,NULL),
(445,'CMD-20260501105743-a0663f','commend',24,24,1,5,'Got a ThankQ award for fixing the ARRC SharePoint directory from my Qantas Manager Rob.','1777604263_ThankQ.jpg','approved',4,'2026-07-14 09:40:49','This is a great example of Exceeding Expectations - going beyond the ask instead of settling for the minimum. Recognizing this kind of initiative encourages the whole team to keep raising the bar.','2026-07-15 06:56:30','2026-05-01 02:57:43','internal',NULL,NULL),
