(542,'CMD-20260505080423-f0d9c5','commend',50,30,4,5,'Great leadership takes heart and courage. Nicko and Ms. Apple really stepped up for Team Earthquake this Q1, leading us to a well-deserved win! Even with everything else on their plates, they made the Labor Day event so special, especially with the tribute to our everyday heroes like the magtataho and jeepney drivers. \r\n\r\nI’m so proud to be part of this team. Let’s go for the win again next quarter!',NULL,'approved',4,'2026-07-14 09:40:49','This captures Fun and Focused well - keeping spirits high without losing sight of the work. Moments like this are a big part of why people enjoy being part of the team.','2026-07-15 05:59:34','2026-05-05 00:04:23','internal',NULL,NULL),
