(547,'CMD-20260505085945-8f17a0','commend',50,16,3,5,'Sir Alvin made waffles for everyone today. Since KMC endorsed Waffle Monday, not every employee usually gets one, but Sir Alvin made sure everyone here was included today.\r\n\r\nI really have to hand it to him for buying the ingredients and cooking waffles for everyone here at RESONO. Thank you very much po!',NULL,'approved',4,'2026-07-14 09:40:49','Small, consistent acts like this are what Genuinely Caring looks like day to day. Thank you for taking the time to notice and name it - it reinforces the kind of colleague we want more of.','2026-07-15 06:36:35','2026-05-05 00:59:45','internal',NULL,NULL),
(548,'CMD-20260505090409-7e3cd3','commend',20,18,3,5,'I want to express my gratitude to Ate Apple for her consistent support. She is always approachable and ready to clarify things whenever we are confused. Thank you, Ate, for your patience and for always sharing your knowledge with us.',NULL,'approved',4,'2026-07-14 09:40:49','Small, consistent acts like this are what Genuinely Caring looks like day to day. Thank you for taking the time to notice and name it - it reinforces the kind of colleague we want more of.','2026-07-15 06:21:25','2026-05-05 01:04:09','internal',NULL,NULL),
(549,'CMD-20260505090902-167d3f','commend',20,30,4,5,'I’m honestly amazed by how your brain works—you have such a perfect balance of being ideal and rational. You bring a certain \'flavor\' and energy that lights up the room the moment you walk in. Thank you for the endless laughter! Just a reminder: we always miss your presence whenever you’re away in Bicol. Keep that \'kabadingan\' and coolness alive. Thankieeeee!',NULL,'approved',4,'2026-07-14 09:40:49','This captures Fun and Focused well - keeping spirits high without losing sight of the work. Moments like this are a big part of why people enjoy being part of the team.','2026-07-15 05:59:35','2026-05-05 01:09:02','internal',NULL,NULL),
