(565,'CMD-20260505095954-2c88f3','commend',43,6,4,5,'I’d like to take a moment to commend everyone for the incredible cooperation and team effort you all showed during our recent holiday pakulo. It was great to see how each of you contributed your time, energy, and creativity to make the activity both fun and successful.\r\n\r\nThank you all for actively participating and bringing such a positive spirit throughout the event. The outcome truly reflects what we can achieve when we work together and support one another.\r\n\r\nHooray to a job well done! Let’s carry this same enthusiasm and teamwork into our upcoming events. Cheers to more successful and memorable moments ahead!',NULL,'approved',4,'2026-07-14 09:40:49','This captures Fun and Focused well - keeping spirits high without losing sight of the work. Moments like this are a big part of why people enjoy being part of the team.','2026-07-14 17:47:31','2026-05-05 01:59:54','internal',NULL,NULL),
