(706,'CMD-20260513165835-81fc5b','commend',15,2,3,5,'A deserving 5 stars for the following nominated agents for initiating an event outside Resono office. This really proves that the bond and engagement created is more than just the four corners of the office. Teamwork and sportsmanship prevailed as the agents enjoyed playing beach volleyball under the scorching heat of the sun. It started just as a normal planned outing last 2024 and eventually became an annual/biannual Resono Outside Office event. It\'s always a joy to share life experiences with colleagues even after work so good job and keep doing this. Hopefully more agents will be inspired and will join next time.',NULL,'approved',4,'2026-07-14 09:40:49','Small, consistent acts like this are what Genuinely Caring looks like day to day. Thank you for taking the time to notice and name it - it reinforces the kind of colleague we want more of.','2026-07-14 17:30:02','2026-05-13 08:58:35','internal',NULL,NULL),
