(809,'CMD-20260531195930-e4f5ca','commend',30,8,4,5,'- Inspires & Motivates Others\r\n\r\nI want to give a massive shoutout to five of my incredible teammates for pulling off a heartfelt EEEE-2 (Earthquake\'s Epic Epicenter Event): Mother’s Day Celebration in the office. This event showed genuine gratitude to all the mothers for their dedication both at home and at work, building a culture of appreciation and connection within the team.\r\n\r\n- Lyn - Epicenter Director: The central point of coordination, oversee the entire event pulse.\r\n\r\n- Alvin and Kier - Designed the Photo Wall.\r\n- Ro-an and Aljay - mom photo research and Program flow\r\n\r\nI received personal feedback from team members sharing that the event allowed them to take a moment to appreciate their mothers, leaving them feeling inspired and motivated to do their best work.','1780228770_20260513_102928.jpg','approved',4,'2026-07-14 09:40:49','This captures Fun and Focused well - keeping spirits high without losing sight of the work. Moments like this are a big part of why people enjoy being part of the team.','2026-07-15 06:00:43','2026-05-31 11:59:30','internal',NULL,NULL),
