(1032,'CMD-20260630171404-0e60d8','commend',18,19,3,3,'I would like to commend Mike for his support during my Seat Rem task when I was unable to extract the workload. He readily stepped in, offered his assistance, and helped me so that I can complete my task that day. Great job, Mike—keep it up!',NULL,'approved',4,'2026-07-14 09:40:49','Small, consistent acts like this are what Genuinely Caring looks like day to day. Thank you for taking the time to notice and name it - it reinforces the kind of colleague we want more of.',NULL,'2026-06-30 09:14:04','internal',NULL,NULL),
(1033,'CMD-20260630171709-24552b','commend',18,21,2,4,'I want to commend Jake for not only embracing the Seat Rem task but also for gaining a full understanding of its turnaround. His reliability and expertise give us confidence that we can depend on him.',NULL,'approved',4,'2026-07-14 09:40:49','This shows real Remarkably Flexible - staying open to change and bouncing back without losing momentum. Calling it out reinforces that adaptability is valued here, not just tolerated.','2026-07-14 17:42:05','2026-06-30 09:17:09','internal',NULL,NULL),
