(1134,'CMD-20260630231625-734622','commend',22,26,3,5,'Promotes Fairness and Mutual Respect\r\n\r\nI appreciate that Kay lets me know whenever she needs to borrow something from my locker, such as Pancit Canton for her breakfast, and always replaces it afterward.\r\n\r\nKay\'s honesty and trustworthiness demonstrate her strong character. These qualities show that she is capable of overcoming any challenges or obstacles she may encounter throughout her journey.',NULL,'approved',4,'2026-07-14 09:40:49','Small, consistent acts like this are what Genuinely Caring looks like day to day. Thank you for taking the time to notice and name it - it reinforces the kind of colleague we want more of.','2026-07-15 05:58:31','2026-06-30 15:16:25','internal',NULL,NULL),
(1135,'CMD-20260630232637-ffe808','commend',22,36,1,5,'Delivers Ahead of Time\r\n\r\nDespite the Ancillary Department\'s demanding workload, Kier consistently manages his responsibilities while actively participating in multiple events and activities organized by Team Earthquake.\r\n\r\nHis dedication and valuable contributions have been instrumental in ensuring that these events are executed smoothly and successfully.',NULL,'approved',4,'2026-07-14 09:40:49','This is a great example of Exceeding Expectations - going beyond the ask instead of settling for the minimum. Recognizing this kind of initiative encourages the whole team to keep raising the bar.','2026-07-15 07:14:53','2026-06-30 15:26:37','internal',NULL,NULL),
(1136,'CMD-20260630233445-a6d2a0','commend',22,30,3,5,'Driven by Purpose\r\n\r\nNicko and Ate Apple consistently demonstrate their commitment to doing whatever is necessary for the success of the team. Their efforts are driven not by recognition, points, or personal achievement, but by a genuine concern for the well-being and engagement of everyone in the office.\r\n\r\nTheir dedication and hard work have transformed their ideas into meaningful activities that foster a fun, positive, and encouraging workplace while maintaining a high level of professionalism. Their willingness to invest time and effort reflects their passion for creating an environment where employees can thrive and enjoy coming to work.',NULL,'approved',4,'2026-07-14 09:40:49','Small, consistent acts like this are what Genuinely Caring looks like day to day. Thank you for taking the time to notice and name it - it reinforces the kind of colleague we want more of.','2026-07-15 05:58:51','2026-06-30 15:34:45','internal',NULL,NULL),
