(1234,'CMD-20260715062717-83f8bd','commend',43,20,1,5,'I’d like to commend this teammate for always being bright and early, despite the long distance they travel each day. Their dedication and commitment are truly inspiring and serve as a great example to the rest of the team.',NULL,'pending',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-14 22:27:17','internal',NULL,NULL),
(1235,'CMD-20260715063109-dac2c6','commend',43,46,2,5,'I\'d like to commend my fellow business owners for always coming up with fresh ideas when restocking and making an effort to keep our product selections unique so we don\'t end up selling the same items. 😂 I truly appreciate your creativity and thoughtfulness. Love you guys!',NULL,'pending',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-14 22:31:09','internal',NULL,NULL),
