(1237,'CMD-20260715064227-7d231b','commend',43,6,1,5,'I\'d like to commend these amazing people for always being there to support us, even when it\'s beyond their usual responsibilities. Whether it\'s changing VGA cables, helping with IT-related favors, or assisting with any unexpected issue, they\'re always just one chat away. Thank you for your willingness to help and for always going the extra mile. We truly appreciate you guys!',NULL,'pending',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-14 22:42:27','internal',NULL,NULL),
