(1241,'CMD-20260715190428-9197ea','commend',15,14,3,5,'I\'d like to award 5 stars to madam Meg under category genuinely caring. She was there ready to help me when I had issues with my phone. She extended assistance without any hesitations which I deeply appreciate. I am forever grateful for her act of kindness.',NULL,'pending',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-15 11:04:28','internal',NULL,NULL),
(1242,'CMD-20260715191951-7f222b','commend',15,54,2,5,'I am awarding 5 stars to JJ for trying his best in every task assignment/workload given. I see progress and improvements on some tasks (FF Inbox, Bundle and Fare Credit Monitoring) as compared to the first few months he handled it.  He openly accepts feedback and tries to minimise his errors. He had no issues with attendance as well so keep doing the right thing and keep the flame burning.',NULL,'pending',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-15 11:19:51','internal',NULL,NULL),
(1243,'CMD-20260715193021-d1b5f0','commend',15,37,1,5,'I am awarding 5 stars to Adriane and Patrick for stepping up bigtime when it comes to BCU  and Seat remediation task. These guys have been at the forefront when these task were first rolled out and they continuously provide updates and other infos (cheet sheets) to make the task lighter and more organized. I appreciate their wit and talent poured into this. Continue to be awesome and keep the flame burning.',NULL,'pending',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-15 11:30:21','internal',NULL,NULL),
(1244,'CMD-20260715193021-d1b5f0','commend',15,22,1,5,'I am awarding 5 stars to Adriane and Patrick for stepping up bigtime when it comes to BCU  and Seat remediation task. These guys have been at the forefront when these task were first rolled out and they continuously provide updates and other infos (cheet sheets) to make the task lighter and more organized. I appreciate their wit and talent poured into this. Continue to be awesome and keep the flame burning.',NULL,'pending',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-15 11:30:21','internal',NULL,NULL),
(1245,'CMD-20260715194026-0f0c35','commend',15,21,1,5,'This one\'s a major, so it\'s only fitting enough to award 5 big stars to Jake. He is definitely the go-to guy when it comes to Seat remediation task. His quick wit and mastery of the task makes him special amongst all Ancillary agents. He has been doing most of the QA for this, hence extending time and effort on his part which the management really appreciates. He\'s very funny and easy to work with which makes the task lighter. Keep the flame burning and hold it high enough so you can be an inspiration to others. Good job!',NULL,'pending',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-15 11:40:26','internal',NULL,NULL),
(1246,'CMD-20260715194830-e68f3a','commend',15,9,2,5,'A deserving 5 stars to Dave for continuously extending his help to Ancillary team by doing QF Retro and BCU task. He has already shown his flexible trait many times and time and time proves that he is still the guy who can be easily trained when time calls. All his efforts are being noticed and we appreciate it so much. So thank you and keep it going!',NULL,'pending',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-15 11:48:30','internal',NULL,NULL),
(1247,'CMD-20260715195724-9908f3','commend',15,23,1,5,'A deserving 5 blinking stars to Markie for his role as the Captain of Team Cyclone. This guy has shown, efficiency, strong leadership skills and a fun personality making him a perfect fit for the role. This was tested during the Badminton league, he continuously pushes everyone from the team to be at their best and be competitive. He\'s also a visionary, he executes what he has on mind and is never afraid of bold moves. He\'s definitely the rock that the team is clinging on to. You\'re presence is already a blessing, keep up the good work and make your mama proud.',NULL,'pending',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-15 11:57:24','internal',NULL,NULL),
(1248,'CMD-20260715201346-21e238','commend',15,20,2,5,'Always and have always been that reliable girl that the Ancillary Team has. A deserving 5 hot stars to Aubrey for being that kind of person. Her natural instincts and fun personality makes the workroom and the work more easy. She has a habit of always reminding everyone things that most of her colleagues forget. She\'s also a flexible person at work doing Payments tasks, Ancillary BAU, Seat Remediation and BCU. You can definitely rely a task on her and expect it to be completed in the right way.  All your efforts are being noticed and we appreciate it so much. So thank you and keep being awesome!',NULL,'pending',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-15 12:13:46','internal',NULL,NULL),
(1249,'CMD-20260715202757-10ad20','commend',15,43,3,5,'I am awarding 5 amazing stars to Freshell, from the Nectar Brand for this very reason. This might seem a small thing to some but to me, it\'s a great help whenever she turns on the PC every morning. This goes to show that she cares for her colleagues. She\'s been throwing funny banters as well which is a surprise compared to the first few months I\'ve known her in the office. It\'s always great to have you around. Your gentle aura brings good vibes and peace to everyone so continue to be an inspiration and keep being awesome!',NULL,'pending',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-15 12:27:57','internal',NULL,NULL),
(1250,'CMD-20260715203851-c6dd70','commend',15,29,2,5,'I want to award 5 cool stars to Stylle. Her funny antics and banters with her colleagues are gold and makes the room burst into laughter. Her presence is a joy to everyone. She is also now considered to be a flexible agent doing BCU task, Seat remediation and other Ancillary BAU tasks. Her efforts in extending her time in doing OT\'s will not be forgotten. We appreciate her small ways of helping the team. So keep up the good work and make us proud.',NULL,'pending',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-15 12:38:51','internal',NULL,NULL),
(1251,'CMD-20260715205122-366bd4','commend',15,23,4,5,'5 gold stars are coming straight to you Mark for your endless ideas and recommendations for the EEP most especially the game for the month of June. It was indeed a witty and fun game experience. Our neurons really worked hard just to win the game. It made the whole participants actively participate and contribute. We end up winning, brains working and well-informed. Good job, you\'ve definetly showcased your creativity side. Keep sending entries!',NULL,'pending',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-15 12:51:22','internal',NULL,NULL),
(1252,'CMD-20260715211812-12e2aa','commend',15,46,4,5,'I am giving 5 beautiful stars to Joshua for always bringing fun and laughter inside the workroom making life at work lighter and more easy. His funny antics and witty infos are a gem. You\'re presence is what we look forward every working day so keep on inspiring others and be that image of strength.',NULL,'pending',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-15 13:18:12','internal',NULL,NULL),
(1253,'CMD-20260717085137-2e614e','commend',27,2,1,5,'Thank you to Prof Francis for helping me to edit the unusual errors in Nexus this will be his chance to improve the system and focus what\'s coming in the future',NULL,'pending',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-17 00:51:37','internal',NULL,NULL),
(1254,'CMD-20260717085725-f926ea','commend',27,6,4,5,'To team Cyclone: \r\n\r\nThank you for a wonderful and fun activity we did. Including our CAPTAIN - MARKIE for leading the team and the other members that giving a suggestions or strategies for the success of the team. It\'s great that I\'m part of this team. Keep it up more fun activities and enjoy the game. laugh as you can to release the stress and GGWP. MAKE A WIND!!!.... TEAM CYCLONEEEEEE',NULL,'pending',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-17 00:57:25','internal',NULL,NULL),
